BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cirque Alfonse: La Noce
DTSTART:20261008T190000
DTEND:20261008T210000
DTSTAMP:20261008T175446Z
UID:10c411a928e99c26481d5d0c1b013e@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:LA NOCE is a joyful celebration of love\, family\, and communi
 ty through circus\, live music\, and playful humor. This lively and colorf
 ul performance transforms the stage into a festive wedding party filled wi
 th acrobatics\, music\, and audience participation. Inspired by a vibrant 
 1970s aesthetic\, the show blends Caribbean rhythms and Québécois folk m
 usic in a warm\, high-energy atmosphere. Bursting with imagination\, darin
 g circus arts\, and heartfelt fun\, La Noce showcases the signature spirit
  of Cirque Alfonse: creativity\, connection\, and joyful celebration.\n\nS
 ources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:The Flynn\, 153 Main St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/cirque-alf
 onse-la-noce-28-09-2026-16-19-12
END:VEVENT
