BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LOST NATION film screening
DTSTART:20261008T183000
DTEND:20261008T210000
DTSTAMP:20261008T175446Z
UID:c075bf2460a1f9f2650d84b4d5d4e3@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Vermont filmmaker Jay Craven will present a screening of his f
 ilm\, LOST NATION\, set in Vermont during the turbulent American Revolutio
 n and featuring characters including larger-than-life rebel instigator Eth
 an Allen and pioneering Black poet\, Lucy Terry Prince. Craven will introd
 uce the film\, setting the historical and dramatic stage - and lead post-s
 creenng Q & A. The film stars Kevin Ryan as Ethan Allen and Eva Ndache as 
 Lucy Terry Prince.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Williamsville Hall\, 30 Dover Rd
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/lost-natio
 n-film-screening-04-10-2026-11-19-11
END:VEVENT
